Historical response: @338511 We're here to help! Can you provide more details on what's going on? Please do not account/personal details.

^LL
@338511 Truly sorry to hear of this, Phillip. We are here to help! Was this order shipped by Amazon or a seller? Let us know! ^JE
@338511 I'd like to have a member from our support team lend you a hand; please reach out to us here: https://t.co/JzP7hlA23B ^WM
@338511 Please give us another chance to help you out. Call us using the link we provided from above. ^MH
@338511 Please keep us posted on how the call goes, we want to ensure this issue is addressed for you. ^GR

Customer: @115821 Help... I ordered from prime on Sunday, my items were to be delivered mon, then tues and now I have checked and they have been broke
@115821 How do I tell if it was direct or not?
@AmazonHelp It says I have no orders, does it make a difference that I am a UK customer?
@AmazonHelp It says sold by amazon EU?
@AmazonHelp Again this is the American version? I am UK
@AmazonHelp Please help? I need a UK contact?
@AmazonHelp I’m sorry but you have not helped me at all, this is disgusting! This is my order number 202-2386021-7214727 I just want my product!
@AmazonHelp No it’s say view tracking details and then it just says damaged in transit please contact amazon? Then no contact number or anything
Historical response: @302628 Hello! I'm sorry to hear that your item was damaged in transit &amp; returned! Was this sold by Amazon or a third-party seller?^FR
@302628 We're happy to help! You can find out whether it was sold by us or a Third-Party seller here: https://t.co/Y5jpI9gRhE ^ML
@302628 Whoops!  Sorry about that!  Here's the correct link:  https://t.co/aaDyEz1VgE ^MW
@302628 Please call or chat with us here: https://t.co/hApLpMlfHN ^MH
@302628 Sorry about that, please use this link instead: https://t.co/JzP7hlA23B ^BG
@302628 My apologies for the frustration! We don't have acct access via Twitter, but we do want to help! Were you able to contact 1/2
@302628 using this link: https://t.co/JzP7hlA23B If so, what options or insight did we provide? Please let us know! ^KN 2/2

Customer: Very unimpressed with @115830 customer services today!
@AmazonHelp 2 parcels to my address (one from me one from my mums account) marked as delivered but not actually delivered. Both are presents for my
@AmazonHelp Fiancé. Told by customer service to wait 24 hours. My fiancé has no presents to open when he gets home from work
@AmazonHelp Yes I have, did those before contacting customer services
@AmazonHelp The investigation I was told to wait 24hrs for, said that “the carrier has confirmed it has been delivered” obviously it hasn’t been
@AmazonHelp I was asked to wait 24hrs whilst you investigated. Replacement offered and said I’d receive an email about it which I haven’t had.
Historical response: @126332 Truly sorry, this isn't what we intend! Without personal or account info could you tell us a bit about what's happened? ^JE
@126332 Have you already tried a few of these troubleshooting steps for locating these parcels: https://t.co/fNj2BBBncC? ^WM
@126332 Please keep us posted on your deliveries, Elanor. ^KN
@126332 When you reached out, were we able to offer any other options like a refund or replacement? Were you asked to wait? ^VS
@126332 If you don't receive correspondence after the 24-hour waiting period, please let us know. ^SB
